{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07321","headline":"泛曲阿後湖简同游诸公 · 刘长卿","name":"泛曲阿後湖简同游诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元气浮积水，沈沈深不流。\n春风万顷绿，映带至徐州。\n爲客难适意，逢君方暂游。\n夤缘白苹际，日暮沧浪舟。\n渡口微月进，林西残雨收。\n水云去仍湿，沙鹤鸣相留。\n且习子陵隐，能忘生事忧。\n此中深有意，非爲钓鱼钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}